  "description": "Welcome to this light-filled MCM gem in the heart of Genesee, just one block from Genesee Hill Elementary! Thoughtfully  designed for effortless indoor-outdoor living, the stunning living room features french doors, a cozy gas fireplace, and  abundant natural light, while multiple sliding doors on main level open to the deck and beautifully landscaped grounds.  The fully fenced yard is a gardener’s dream, complete with a flagstone patio, Mt. Rainier views, and hot tub—perfect for  relaxing under the stars. The finished lower level offers a spacious family room with a second gas fireplace, bedroom,  utility room, and ample storage. Car enthusiasts, makers, and hobbyists will love the attached 1-car garage plus RARE  detached 2-car garage with alley access and plenty of room for a workshop. Fresh interior paint, new sewer line & hot  water tank in 2026. Incredible location near Schmitz Park Reserve with trails to Alki Beach, plus an easy stroll to Alaska  Junction’s beloved shops, dining, and weekend farmers market. A truly special West Seattle home!",
